# Accessibility

- Label every input; use `inputmode="decimal"` for numeric fields; font-size ≥16px on inputs.
- Tap targets ≥48px on mobile controls.
- Visible focus styles; skip link present.
- Maintain contrast on brand greens/oranges against backgrounds.
- `aria-live` on results; keyboard-operable unit toggles and nav.
- Decorative icons `aria-hidden`; meaningful alt text when images are added.
